 you can relax to automatically generated routines based on your tastes\n\n- Challenge yourself! Each session is given a simple grade based on how well you follow along. Use that to motivate yourself each time or even for bragging rights among friends!", "short_description": "Hit yoga poses to the beat of the music, including your own!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.soaringrocstudio.net/rhythm-yoga-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Soaring Roc Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://soaringrocstudio.net/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["MUSIC", "RELAXATION_MEDITATION", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "4497617800364123"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "643145987036424"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "643145987036424"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1640110500, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "643145987036424"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "4220080121434122", "version": ".03"}, "id": "466213341207715", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "41945